        "content": "{\n  \"analysis\": \"QEMU is running with the required infrastructure (VNC :1/5901, monitor socket, snapshot mode, nginx/noVNC on port 80, websockify on 6080), but the VM display remains in 720x400 VGA text mode with only a cursor. We need to diagnose whether the VM is at a DOS prompt, booting, or stuck. The advisor suggests reading the VGA text buffer, inspecting the disk partition contents, and checking whether the CPU is advancing.\",\n  \"plan\": \"Dump VGA text memory via QEMU monitor `pmemsave` and decode it to see any hidden text. Mount the FAT16 partition at offset 32256 (LBA 63) to inspect DOS/Windows boot files and AUTOEXEC.BAT/CONFIG.SYS. Sample CPU registers twice to determine if EIP is advancing.\",\n  \"commands\": [\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"python3 << 'EOF'\\nimport socket, time, os\\ns = socket.socket(socket.AF_UNIX, socket.SOCK_STREAM)\\ns.connect(\\\"/tmp/qemu-monitor.sock\\\")\\ntime.sleep(0.3)\\nprint(s.recv(4096).decode(), end=\\\"\\\")\\ns.send(b\\\"pmemsave 0xb8000 4000 /tmp/vga_text.bin\\\\n\\\")\\ntime.sleep(1)\\nprint(s.recv(4096).decode(), end=\\\"\\\")\\ns.close()\\nprint(\\\"Saved:\\\", os.path.exists(\\\"/tmp/vga_text.bin\\\"), os.path.getsize(\\\"/tmp/vga_text.bin\\\") if os.path.exists(\\\"/tmp/vga_text.bin\\\") else 0)\\nEOF\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 1.0\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"python3 << 'EOF'\\ndata = open('/tmp/vga_text.bin','rb').read()\\nfor row in range(0, 4000, 160):\\n    line = bytearray()\\n    for i in range(row, row+160, 2):\\n        ch = data[i]\\n        if 32 <= ch < 127:\\n            line.append(ch)\\n        elif ch == 0:\\n            line.append(ord(' '))\\n        else:\\n            line.append(ord('.'))\\n    text = bytes(line).rstrip(b' ')\\n    print(f\\\"{row//160:02d}: {text.decode()}\\\")\\nEOF\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 0.5\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"mkdir -p /mnt/win311\\nmount -o loop,ro,offset=32256 /app/isos/win311.img /mnt/win311 2>/dev/null || mount -o loop,ro /app/isos/win311.img /mnt/win311 2>/dev/null || true\\nls -la /mnt/win311 | head -80\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 0.5\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"find /mnt/win311 -maxdepth 2 \\\\( -iname 'command.com' -o -iname 'io.sys' -o -iname 'msdos.sys' -o -iname 'autoexec.bat' -o -iname 'config.sys' -o -iname 'win.com' \\\\) 2>/dev/null | sort\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 0.5\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"echo \\\"=== AUTOEXEC.BAT ===\\\"; cat /mnt/win311/AUTOEXEC.BAT 2>/dev/null | tr -d '\\\\r' | head -80 || true\\necho \\\"=== CONFIG.SYS ===\\\"; cat /mnt/win311/CONFIG.SYS 2>/dev/null | tr -d '\\\\r' | head -80 || true\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 0.5\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"python3 << 'EOF'\\nimport socket, time\\ns = socket.socket(socket.AF_UNIX, socket.SOCK_STREAM)\\ns.connect(\\\"/tmp/qemu-monitor.sock\\\")\\ntime.sleep(0.3)\\ns.recv(4096)\\ns.send(b\\\"info registers\\\\n\\\")\\ntime.sleep(0.3)\\nprint(s.recv(4096).decode())\\ntime.sleep(1)\\ns.send(b\\\"info registers\\\\n\\\")\\ntime.sleep(0.3)\\nprint(s.recv(4096).decode())\\ns.close()\\nEOF\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 2.0\n    }\n  ]\n}",
